From e5af7520467076f75d3db76d4a0234722c56e79a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ZetOmega <70434161+ZetOmega@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 17:33:05 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] signal: [[react:<emoji>]] replies become reactions
 (extra.auto_react)

Let the agent answer with a Signal reaction instead of (or besides) text.

With platforms.signal.extra.auto_react: true, a reply starting with
[[react:<emoji>]] is sent as a reaction on the triggering message; any text
after the token is still sent as a normal message. The token is always
stripped so it can never leak into a chat; invalid tokens (not an emoji) or
auto_react off are dropped. Also adds add_reaction() so
send_message(action="react") works on Signal, and the agent's own reaction is
not overwritten by the final check-mark/cross outcome reaction.

Env fallback: SIGNAL_AUTO_REACT.
---
 gateway/platforms/signal.py             |  61 ++++++++++
 tests/gateway/test_signal_auto_react.py | 153 ++++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 214 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 tests/gateway/test_signal_auto_react.py

